description: Regex provider factory naming - must use GetForRetrieving...
globs:
  - RagDataTools.Chunkers/Infrastructure/TextChunksRegexProvider.cs
  - RagDataTools.Chunkers/Infrastructure/ChunkTypesRegexProvider.cs
alwaysApply: false
