## Rule
- Any regex provider factory method you call (the method name on the `regexProvider` instance) must start with `GetForRetrieving...`.
- Do not introduce or use regex provider factory methods with other prefixes (for example `Build...`, `Create...`, `Get...`, `Make...`, etc.).
